      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 19 引入 REPACK 命令",
      "summary": "Álvaro Herrera 在 3 月 10 日提交了 Antonin Houska 的补丁：PostgreSQL 19 新增 REPACK 命令，把 VACUUM FULL 与 CLUSTER 合并成一套接口。不带索引就是去膨胀，带 USING INDEX 则按索引重排并标记为聚簇索引。进度可从 pg_stat_progress_repack 视图看，原有两条命令保留但不再主推。并发版本没有进来，作者称这只是第一步。",
      "url": "https://www.depesz.com/2026/03/19/waiting-for-postgresql-19-introduce-the-repack-command/",
      "author": "Hubert 'depesz' Lubaczewski",
      "source": "depesz 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-03-19",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "PostgreSQL 19",
        "REPACK",
        "维护"
      ],
      "position": 1
